course: dictionary
lesson: 4333
title: Grumpy: a bad mood
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Grumpy is an adjective. It describes how a person feels or acts: in a bad mood, easily annoyed and complaining a lot. Grumpier and grumpiest show more and most grumpy.
explain: Notice why you feel grumpy. Tiredness, hunger, being ill or a bad day often cause it. «After a week of grumpy mornings» tells you the feeling can last for days, and eating, resting or talking to someone can help.
explain: It is okay to feel grumpy, but it is not okay to be unkind because of it. Feelings and actions are different: you can feel grumpy and still be kind.
fact: Grumpy means in a bad mood, easily annoyed and complaining a lot.
fact: Grumpier compares two people or times; grumpiest means the most grumpy of all.
fact: «A grumpy face» and «grumpy old man» are common phrases.
fact: «Mardy» (Midlands and North of England) means grumpy or sulky.
fact: In stories, a grumpy character often softens by the end, like Grumpy in «Snow White».
exercise: «The same person can be grumpy about small things and very kind when it matters.» What does grumpy mean here? | *In a bad mood and easily annoyed | Very happy and full of jokes | Lost and confused | Quiet and shy
exercise: In Newcastle, «howay» means «come on». In the Midlands and the North, what does «mardy» mean? | Very tall | *Grumpy or sulky | Hungry | Friendly and kind
exercise: Which word means in a bad mood and complaining a lot? | *Grumpy | Curious | Gentle | Grateful
test: «Some people stay grumpy whatever you do; then it is fine to play somewhere else.» What does this sentence suggest you can do if someone stays grumpy? | Shout back at them until they stop | Stay and argue all day | *Play somewhere else | Pretend you cannot see them
test: Which word do you use to compare the most grumpy person in a group of three or more? | Grumpy | Grumpier | *Grumpiest | Grumps
exam: Which is the best way to deal with feeling grumpy because you are hungry? | *Eat something | Shout at your friends | Stay grumpy all day | Hide from everyone for a week
